        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tron, The Million Dollar Duck\n- People: Steven Lisberger, Bonnie MacBird, Jeff Bridges\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Concepts: science fiction action-adventure films, comedy films, mainframe computers, golden eggs\n\nFacts:\n- The Million Dollar Duck, also titled The $1,000,000 Duck, is a 1971 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- The Million Dollar Duck is about a goose that lays golden eggs.\n- Tron is a 1982 American science fiction action-adventure film written and directed by Steven Lisberger.\n- Tron is based on a story by Steven Lisberger and Bonnie MacBird.\n- Tron was produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Tron stars Jeff Bridges as a computer programmer transported into the software world of a mainframe computer, where he interacts with programs while trying to escape.",
